WHAT THIS COVERS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT

The MIT licence above applies to the code in this repository: the binkw32 proxy
(proxy/), the installer and tooling (tools/), and the documentation.

It does NOT cover anything belonging to Tropico. Tropico is the property of its
rights holders (PopTop Software, Kalypso Media). No game code, game art, sound,
text or data is contained in this repository or in any release built from it.

The user interface art this patch installs is GENERATED ON YOUR OWN MACHINE from
the game archives in your own legally obtained copy, by tools/tropico-artset.py.
It is derived from your files, it never leaves your machine, and it is not
redistributed here. Installing this patch requires that you already own the game.

The proxy forwards every function of binkw32.dll to the original file, which the
installer preserves beside it as binkw32_orig.dll. Bink is the property of RAD
Game Tools / Epic Games; none of its code is reimplemented or redistributed here.

This project is unofficial and unaffiliated. See NOTICE for the full statement.
